msgstr ""
"`observable_representation_rankme`：`representationId = "
"\"lm_head::input\"`、`tokenPositionsAsSamples = true`、`captureTrajectories"
" = false`。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/rank-collapse-tinyshakespeare.md:122
msgid ""
"`observable_representation_alpha_req`: `representationId = "
"\"lm_head::input\"`, `tokenPositionsAsSamples = true`."
msgstr ""
"`observable_representation_alpha_req`：`representationId = "
